%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 286 72
%%Creator: yExport 1.5
%%Producer: org.freehep.graphicsio.ps.EPSGraphics2D Revision: 12753 
%%For: 
%%Title: 
%%CreationDate: Donnerstag, 3. September 2026 um 14:42:49 Mitteleuropäische Sommerzeit
%%LanguageLevel: 3
